<body><main class="wrap">
<div class="intro"><h1>Cache Read Trace · Hit / Miss / LRU / Pseudo-LRU</h1><span class="hint">一个地址序列 · 两种独立的替换策略</span></div>
<div class="config"><span><strong>Operation:</strong> CPU READ</span><span><strong>Cache:</strong> 2 Sets × 4 Ways = 8 Lines</span><span><strong>Line Size:</strong> 16 Bytes / Line</span><span><strong>Policy:</strong> True LRU vs Tree Pseudo-LRU</span></div>
<div aria-label="CPU read access sequence" class="trace" id="trace"></div>
<div class="work">
<section aria-label="Current read request" class="card request-card">
